<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italian 10-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for an 11th tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.59 pct vs	6.93 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.50 pct vs	7.86 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 95.70     vs     93.40</p>
<p> Bids		 3.923 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a ninth tranche of the 10-year BTP on March 27.</p>
</text>
